orresponding clasp. Check the included parts for this piece. One charm occupies one position at a time.</p><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/the-mechanism' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Core-Lock &amp; Modular System<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></section><section><h2>Already own a piece?</h2><p>Tell us which base or charm you have. We can confirm the missing parts instead of assuming you need another complete piece.</p></section><section><h2>Made by hand</h2><p>All our jewelry is handmade. Texture and surface details vary and cannot be guaranteed to match a photo exactly. Materials, dimensions, function and important details confirmed before making still follow the description.</p></section><section><h2>Materials & personal preferences</h2><p>No material can be guaranteed to suit everyone. Titanium alloy may cause a reaction or discomfort for some people. Check all components and processes and email us about your material preferences.</p><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/care-guide#materials' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Materials &amp; care<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></section><section><h2>Delivery, returns & repair</h2><p>Destination-specific delivery costs and timing are confirmed before payment. See the return and clasp-repair information.</p><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/shipping-returns' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Shipping &amp; returns<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/warranty' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Warranty &amp; repair<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></section></div><aside class="r-reading"><p class="r-eyebrow">Before you choose</p><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/blogs/journal/meaningful-jewelry-collection' | replace: '//', '/' }}">A charm collection with memories and room to breathe<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></aside><dialog id="r-size-dialog" class="r-size-dialog" aria-label="Ring size guide"><button type="button" class="r-dialog-close" aria-label="Close size guide">×</button><div class="r-size-guide" id="size-guide"><header><p class="r-eyebrow">Find your fit</p><h2>Ring size guide</h2><p>Current options: 54 mm and 57 mm inner circumference, approximately 17.2 mm and 18.1 mm inner diameter. Measure the intended finger or a ring that fits it.</p></header><div class="r-size-methods"><section><p class="r-eyebrow">01</p><h3>Measure a ring</h3><p>Measure the inside diameter of a ring that fits your chosen finger. Leave the metal edge out of the measurement.</p><form class="r-size-calculator" data-size-calculator><label for="r-size-diameter">Inside diameter (mm)<input id="r-size-diameter" data-size-diameter type="number" min="10" max="30" step="0.1" placeholder="17.2" inputmode="decimal" required></label><button type="submit" class="r-button r-button--line" data-size-calculate>Calculate circumference</button><p data-size-result role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></section><section><p class="r-eyebrow">02</p><h3>Measure your finger</h3><ol class="r-size-steps"><li>Use a ring sizer on the finger you will wear the piece on.</li><li>Check that it passes the knuckle and stays comfortably in place.</li><li>Repeat at different times of day before choosing your size.</li></ol><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/contact' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Ask us about fit<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></section></div><div class="r-size-reference"><h3>International reference</h3><p class="r-caption">Approximate regional equivalents. SUIJI sizes 54 and 57 are highlighted. Scroll horizontally to compare the full table.</p></div><div class="r-table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="International ring size table"><table><caption>Inner circumference in mm; regional systems are approximate</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">EU / FR (mm)</th><th scope="col">Ø (mm)</th><th scope="col">US / CA</th><th